UPDATE platforms SET "description" = $a33$An open-source Python framework for building voice and multimodal AI agents that you can talk to in real time. It is not a voice generator itself: you plug in the transcription, language-model and voice-synthesis services you choose from more than 200 integrated providers, and Pipecat handles interruptions, turn detection and conversation context over WebRTC, SIP or phone (PSTN). It is free under the BSD 2-Clause license and runs wherever Python runs; Pipecat Cloud, run by Daily, is an optional paid host. Maintained by Daily: Deepgram announced on 2026-10-29 that it is acquiring Daily (announced, not completed, as of 2026-11-02) and says Pipecat will stay open source under an independent Pipecat Foundation. Your own provider accounts bill separately (as of 2026-11-02).$a33$, "updatedAt" = now() WHERE slug = $a33$pipecat$a33$ AND "description" = $a33$An open-source Python framework for building voice and multimodal AI agents that you can talk to in real time. You pick the speech-to-text, language-model and text-to-speech services from more than 200 integrated providers, and Pipecat handles interruptions, turn detection and conversation context over WebRTC, SIP or phone (PSTN). It is free under the BSD 2-Clause license and runs wherever Python runs; Pipecat Cloud, run by Daily, is an optional paid host. Maintained by Daily: Deepgram announced on 2026-10-29 that it is acquiring Daily (announced, not completed, as of 2026-11-02) and says Pipecat will stay open source under an independent Pipecat Foundation. Your own provider accounts bill separately (as of 2026-11-02).$a33$;
